<title>PHILIPPINES: FEU stockholders okay 50 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>FEU stockholders okay 50 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Majority stockholders of Far Eastern University (FEU) had ratified a 50 percent stock dividend to be given to shareholders as of February 22, the university said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The dividend will be paid out on March 22, corporate secretary Diosdado Guytingco told the Philippine Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
